   "text": "DuckDB index (read-only when serving)\n· <INDEX_DIR>/<corpus_id>.duckdb, `current` symlink\n· schema version 10; about 150 MB, rebuild 63 s\n  (measured for the first deck)\n· keeps 3 builds",
   "originalText": "DuckDB index (read-only when serving)\n· <INDEX_DIR>/<corpus_id>.duckdb, `current` symlink\n· schema version 10; about 150 MB, rebuild 63 s (measured for the first deck)\n· keeps 3 builds",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
