   "text": "claude-sonnet-5-5, MAX_TOKENS 8,192, MAX_TURNS 8, one asyncio.timeout of 300 s around the whole loop.\nNo temperature set. No retry configuration in this code (SDK default applies).",
   "originalText": "claude-sonnet-5-5, MAX_TOKENS 8,192, MAX_TURNS 8, one asyncio.timeout of 300 s around the whole loop. No temperature set. No retry configuration in this code (SDK default applies).",
