   "text": "The index is a build artifact named by a hash of its inputs and swapped in by a symlink. Content ships separately from code, as a signed archive. Nothing here runs at request time.",
   "originalText": "The index is a build artifact named by a hash of its inputs and swapped in by a symlink. Content ships separately from code, as a signed archive. Nothing here runs at request time.",
