   "text": "Write\n· <INDEX_DIR>/<id>.duckdb.tmp then os.replace\n· tables: meta, pages, course_pages, edges, sections,\n  course_sections, one FTS index per page table\n· meta: schema_version, built_at, embedding_model,\n  embedding_dim, corpus_id",
