   "text": "make eval-gate (floors at run_eval.py:88-111)\n· nightly 03:17 UTC and on PRs touching\n  src/librarian/retrieval/**, evals/**, Makefile\n· 150 golden questions per set, 60 multihop\n· floor = measured 2026-11-08 minus 0.05",
