   "text": "pricing.py PRICES, USD per 1M tokens (in / out / cache\nread / cache write)\n· claude-sonnet-5-5  2 / 10 / 0.20 / 2.50\n· claude-opus-5-5    4 / 20 / 0.20 / 5.00\n· claude-fable-5-1  10 / 50 / 0.25 / 12.50",
