   "text": "PRICES_REVIEWED = 2026-11-19, MAX_AGE_DAYS = 35. A stale\ntable only fails `librarian pricing check` (exit 1);\nnothing at runtime reads the date, and no job runs the\ncheck. P1",
   "originalText": "PRICES_REVIEWED = 2026-11-19, MAX_AGE_DAYS = 35. A stale table only fails `librarian pricing check` (exit 1); nothing at runtime reads the date, and no job runs the check. P1",
