   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Key missing: the service refuses to start when chat is enabled. At run time the stream ends with a\nbracketed marker (error, timeout at 300 s, refusal). Search and the tools keep working.",
   "originalText": "Key missing: the service refuses to start when chat is enabled. At run time the stream ends with a bracketed marker (error, timeout at 300 s, refusal). Search and the tools keep working.",
